{"ID":"20250208124803-2n3op0s","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250208124803-2n3op0s","title":"A3L1——数据结构分类","type":"doc","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-z44t0vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-z44t0vw","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常见的数据结构包括数组、链表、栈、队列、哈希表、树、堆、图，它们可以从“逻辑结构”和“物理结构”两个维度进行分类。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-9oop5ek","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-9oop5ek","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逻辑结构：线性与非线性"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-v2qldhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-v2qldhu","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"逻辑结构揭示了数据元素之间的逻辑关系"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-zm54zw8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-zm54zw8","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-icdl8f8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-icdl8f8","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-1sy4h21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-1sy4h21","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在数组和链表中，数据按照一定顺序排列，体现了数据之间的线性关系；"}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-xl5qbyz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-xl5qbyz","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-6pv95tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-6pv95tg","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而在树中，数据从顶部向下按层次排列，表现出“祖先”与“后代”之间的派生关系；"}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-by5nvz8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-by5nvz8","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-y1d8jzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-y1d8jzj","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图则由节点和边构成，反映了复杂的网络关系。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-u1smi3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-u1smi3s","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如下图所示，逻辑结构可分为“线性”和“非线性”两大类。线性结构比较直观，指数据在逻辑关系上呈线性排列；非线性结构则相反，呈非线性排列。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-avyw8rn","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-avyw8rn","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-15hmuya","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-15hmuya","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-99vk10o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-99vk10o","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"线性数据结构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：数组、链表、栈、队列、哈希表，元素之间是一对一的顺序关系。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-46au0kl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-46au0kl","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-z7b3k8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-z7b3k8v","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"非线性数据结构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：树、堆、图、哈希表。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-eotof4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-eotof4f","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非线性数据结构可以进一步划分为树形结构和网状结构。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-s4tgebp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-s4tgebp","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-tveq1o2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-tveq1o2","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-fcpwhty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-fcpwhty","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"树形结构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：树、堆、哈希表，元素之间是一对多的关系。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-glt2ht8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-glt2ht8","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-rr2t3s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-rr2t3s5","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"网状结构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：图，元素之间是多对多的关系。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-l3b8xau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-l3b8xau","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250208123932-lv8re6l.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-xfk4qtk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-xfk4qtk","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理结构：连续与分散"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-qv31d6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-qv31d6s","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当算法程序运行时，正在处理的数据主要存储在内存中"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。下图展示了一个计算机内存条，其中每个黑色方块都包含一块内存空间。\n我们可以将内存想象成一个巨大的 Excel 表格，其中每个单元格都可以存储一定大小的数据。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-k6uf8v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-k6uf8v1","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250208124438-wc0stpc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-93ldugw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-93ldugw","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存是所有程序的共享资源，当某块内存被某个程序占用时，则通常无法被其他程序同时使用了。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"因此在数据结构与算法的设计中，内存资源是一个重要的考虑因素"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-z5a6jsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-z5a6jsc","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如，算法所占用的内存峰值不应超过系统剩余空闲内存；\n如果缺少连续大块的内存空间，那么所选用的数据结构必须能够存储在分散的内存空间内。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-t3vraew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-t3vraew","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如下图所示，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"物理结构反映了数据在计算机内存中的存储方式"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可分为连续空间存储（数组）和分散空间存储（链表）\n物理结构从底层决定了数据的访问、更新、增删等操作方法，两种物理结构在时间效率和空间效率方面呈现出互补的特点。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-o4delcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-o4delcp","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 578px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250208124622-212gvjq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 578px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-p9lma3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-p9lma3p","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"值得说明的是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"所有数据结构都是基于数组、链表或二者的组合实现的"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n例如，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栈和队列既可以使用数组实现，也可以使用链表实现；而哈希表的实现可能同时包含数组和链表。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-ic3uzzj","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-ic3uzzj","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-jl7s25o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-jl7s25o","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-0wiply3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-0wiply3","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"基于数组可实现"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：栈、队列、哈希表、树、堆、图、矩阵、张量（维度 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"≥3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的数组）等。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-6ta7co3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-6ta7co3","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250208124822-0nq6tda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-0nq6tda","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"基于链表可实现"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：栈、队列、哈希表、树、堆、图等。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-neiucej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-neiucej","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"链表在初始化后，仍可以在程序运行过程中对其长度进行调整，因此也称“动态数据结构”。\n数组在初始化后长度不可变，因此也称“静态数据结构”。"}]},{"ID":"20250208124822-jkrqzd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250208124822-jkrqzd5","updated":"20250208124822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"值得注意的是，数组可通过重新分配内存实现长度变化，从而具备一定的“动态性”。"}]}]}